{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Spire is an atmospheric first-person shooter set in a ruined post-apocalyptic city. Fog covers the streets, buildings stand empty, and enemies lurk in the shadows. You\u2019ll have to move through dark districts, scavenge for supplies and weapons, and cling to life where death is waiting at every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends intense gunfights with resource hunting. With more than eight types of weapons \u2014 from old shotguns to assault rifles and grenades \u2014 every battle becomes a test of survival. Each district of the city brings new challenges: scarce ammo, dangerous encounters, and an atmosphere of unending tension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ types of weapons: from rifles to grenades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A post-apocalyptic city swallowed by fog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Looting system for ammo, supplies, and weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Oppressive dark atmosphere with constant tension</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000300?t=1757378700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000300?t=1757378700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000300/960c7dcc6861d672d0a5f498ea991d211a708717/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000300/960c7dcc6861d672d0a5f498ea991d211a708717/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Spire is an atmospheric first-person shooter set in a ruined post-apocalyptic city. Fog covers the streets, buildings stand empty, and enemies lurk in the shadows. You\u2019ll have to move through dark districts, scavenge for supplies and weapons, and cling to life where death is waiting at every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends intense gunfights with resource hunting. With more than eight types of weapons \u2014 from old shotguns to assault rifles and grenades \u2014 every battle becomes a test of survival. Each district of the city brings new challenges: scarce ammo, dangerous encounters, and an atmosphere of unending tension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8+ types of weapons: from rifles to grenades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A post-apocalyptic city swallowed by fog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Looting system for ammo, supplies, and weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Oppressive dark atmosphere with constant tension</p>","developers":["g4m3d3s1gn studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000300/1de51d752d0d0237b744afe20ed20801553def69/header.jpg?t=1757378700","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191745,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191745/movie480.mp4?t=1757378698","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191745/movie_max.mp4?t=1757378698"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191745/749596fca616b9296b3af1052ee8d13eb3f830bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757378698","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191745/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757378698","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191745/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757378698"}}],"name":"Black Spire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,